{"speciesId":309,"names":{"fr":"Dynavolt","es":"Electrike","en":"Electrike","ja":"ラクライ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"ELECTRIKE stores electricity in its long body hair. This POKéMON stimulates its leg muscles with electric charges. These jolts of power give its legs explosive acceleration performance."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"ELECTRIKE runs faster than the human eye can follow. The friction from running is converted into electricity, which is then stored in this POKéMON’s fur."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It generates electricity using friction from the atmosphere. In seasons with especially arid air, its entire body blazes with violent showers of sparks."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It stores static electricity in its fur for discharging. It gives off sparks if a storm approaches."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It stores static electricity in its fur for discharging. It gives off sparks if a storm approaches."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It stores electricity in its fur. It gives off sparks from all over its body in seasons when the air is dry."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It stores electricity in its fur. It gives off sparks from all over its body in seasons when the air is dry."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il améliore ses réflexes en stimulant ses muscles grâce à l’électricité dans sa fourrure."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il améliore ses réflexes en stimulant ses muscles grâce à l’électricité dans sa fourrure."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il améliore ses réflexes en stimulant ses muscles grâce à l’électricité dans sa fourrure."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Estimula sus músculos y aumenta sus reflejos con la electricidad que almacena su pelaje."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体毛に ためた 電気を 使い 筋肉を 刺激することで 瞬発力を 高める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Dynavolt stocke de l’électricité statique dans sa fourrure. Il produit des étincelles lorsque le temps devient orageux."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Acumula electricidad estática en el pelaje para lanzar descargas. Cuando va a haber tormenta, suelta chispas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It stores static electricity in its fur for discharging. It gives off sparks if a storm approaches."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"静電気を 体毛に たくわえて 放電する。嵐が 近づくと 全身から 火花を 散らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dynavolt stocke de l’électricité dans les poils de son corps allongé. Ce Pokémon stimule les muscles de ses jambes avec des charges électriques, ce qui le rend capable d’accélérations fulgurantes."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Electrike acumula electricidad en el largo pelaje que tiene. Este Pokémon estimula los músculos de las patas mediante descargas eléctricas. Estas explosiones de energía le permiten acelerar de forma increíble."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Electrike stores electricity in its long body hair. This Pokémon stimulates its leg muscles with electric charges. These jolts of power give its legs explosive acceleration performance."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"長い 体毛に 電気を ためている。 電流で 足の 筋肉を 刺激して 爆発的 瞬発力を 生み出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dynavolt court tellement vite que l’œil humain ne peut pas le suivre. La friction générée par sa course est convertie en électricité, puis stockée dans la fourrure de ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Electrike corre tan rápido que escapa hasta al ojo humano. La fricción que se origina en la carrera se transforma en electricidad que almacena en el pelaje."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Electrike runs faster than the human eye can follow. The friction from running is converted into electricity, which is then stored in this Pokémon’s fur."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"目にも 止まらぬ スピードで 走る ポケモン。 空気の 摩擦で 電気を 発生させて 全身の 体毛に 蓄えている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La friction de ses poils avec l’air génère de l’électricité statique quand il court et produit un son qui s’apparente à des crépitements."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La fricción con el aire carga su pelaje de electricidad estática, por lo que pueden oírse crepitantes chispazos cuando corre."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Friction between the air and its fur produces static electricity. When Electrike runs, it makes a crackling sound."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"空気と 体毛の 摩擦で 静電気が 発生。 ラクライが 走ると バチバチと 音が 鳴る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est très fier de sa vitesse et peut envelopper son corps d’électricité statique en frottant ses longs poils."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este Pokémon genera electricidad estática frotando su largo pelaje. También destaca por su velocidad."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Static electricity builds up all over its body as strands of its long fur rub together. This Pokémon boasts incredible speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"長い 体毛が こすれあうことで 全身に 静電気が たまる。 スピードが 自慢の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il émet des décharges à partir de l’électricité statique accumulée dans sa fourrure. Il produit des étincelles lorsque le temps devient orageux."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Acumula electricidad estática en el pelaje para lanzar descargas. Cuando va a haber tormenta, suelta chispas por todo el cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It stores static electricity in its fur for discharging. It gives off sparks if a storm approaches."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"静電気を 体毛に たくわえて 放電する。 嵐が 近づくと 全身から 火花を 散らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"L’électricité statique s’accumule dans sa fourrure. Par temps sec, elle dégage des étincelles."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Almacena electricidad estática en su pelaje. En estaciones secas, suelta chispas por todo el cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It stores electricity in its fur. It gives off sparks from all over its body in seasons when the air is dry."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"静電気を 体毛に 溜める。 空気の 乾燥した 季節には 全身から 火花を 散らす。"}],"varieties":[{"id":309,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[1